<title>USA: Marsh &amp; Mclennan has no comment on bid talk.</title>
<headline>Marsh &amp; Mclennan has no comment on bid talk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marsh &amp; McLennan Cos Inc on Friday declined to comment on market talk of a bid for British-based insurance broker Sedgwick Group Plc.</p>
<p>&quot;We do have a policy of not commenting on rumors,&quot; said company spokeswoman Barbara Perlmutter.</p>
<p>Officials at Aon Corp, which was also rumored to be making a bid for Sedgwick, were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Sedgwick said the company's policy was not to comment on market rumors.</p>
</text>
